🌐 FusionDesk – Web Development Internship Project (Apex Planet)
FusionDesk is a bundled web project developed during my internship at Apex Planet to showcase practical frontend development skills using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap.

💡 Includes 3 Projects:

Personal Portfolio – A sleek, responsive portfolio site highlighting skills, projects, and contact links.

To-Do List App – A localStorage-based task manager with add/delete/complete functionality.

Product Filter Page – A dynamic product catalog with real-time filtering and sorting.

🛠️ Tech Stack:
HTML, CSS, Bootstrap 4, JavaScript, DOM Manipulation, Responsive Design

📁 Project Structure:

index.html: Main hub with navigation

port.html: Portfolio page

to-do.html: Task manager

pro.html: Product filter page

Separate CSS files per module
